# Plebian-OS 0.2.3 release requirements.
#
# These are not a partial release manifest. releases/0.2.3.env must
# declare these exact values. The release-image loader rejects a mismatch.
#
# Waydroid stays optional and lazy. Installation is 0, so the closure
# hash is explicitly empty: upgrades clear the old release hash while installation is off.
# The diarization notice licensors match the receipt-bound licensor string.
#
# uv 0.12.5 installer checksum is the value carried from 0.2.2.
# Debian 13.7.0 amd64 netinst SHA256SUMS was verified for 0.2.2 with
# Debian CD key DF9B9C49EAA9298432589D76DA87E80D6294BE9B and is unchanged.
# Empty PLEBIAN_OS_APT_SNAPSHOT selects live Debian sources.

